### 4.5 Networking and tunnel manager

| File                               | Responsibility                       |
| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| `networking/cloudflare_manager.py` | Cloudflare Tunnel lifecycle          |
| `networking/direct_endpoint.py`    | Public inference endpoint management |
